{"parse": {"title": "LAFP-12", "pageid": 136111, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LAFP-11\" title=\"LAFP-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LAFP-12</span><a href=\"/wiki/LAFP-13\" title=\"LAFP-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LAFP</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">12</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.97.A0.E9.99.85.E7.9A.84.E7.BB.BF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"无际的绿\">无际的绿</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 无际的绿</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">That Endless Green</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>世<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>成<span class=\"color-value\"></span>千<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>万<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>独<span class=\"color-value\"></span>属<span class=\"color-value\"></span>于<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>怀<span class=\"color-value\"></span>念<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3610112</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_11\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-3_6_at_11.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-3_6_at_11.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-3_6_at_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>咚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>徒劳而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>真希望下次我的同僚们在自说自话地消失前多留下些提示。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>还真严丝合缝……这不会是画上去的吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>没有明显的锁。也不像有神秘术痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>向谁证明？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>格蕾塔到过这里……她找到过进去的路……一定有办法……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_12.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_12\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_12\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/Cg-3_6_at_12.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_12.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/Cg-3_6_at_12.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_12.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/Cg-3_6_at_12.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_12.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉普拉斯研究员Ⅰ：</div><div>阿德勒研究员？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉普拉斯研究员Ⅰ：</div><div>阿德勒研究员——我们很担心您的状况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉普拉斯研究员Ⅰ：</div><div>针对“暴雨”的调查结果送来了。大伙儿正抢着成立研究小组呢。虽然这很冒昧，但我们想邀请您加入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉普拉斯研究员Ⅱ：</div><div>是的！您可能不记得了，在哥廷根大学的密码学讲座上，您说过，“任何谜题都有其解答”，如果没有答案，那只是因为还没有摸索到规律……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉普拉斯研究员Ⅱ：</div><div>这可是从未有人成功过的填字游戏！在这之前可没有“暴雨”研究！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉普拉斯研究员Ⅰ：</div><div>我们会是最先得到答案，解明真理的人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他面对着眼前被难以分辨的墨迹涂满的填字格子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“暴雨”正是如此毫无规律地覆盖了一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>答案？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——一个能被突然出现的存在随时推翻的“答案”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>恐怕只有狂信徒会欣喜万分，因为他们终于有了证据，能辩称的确有神。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_13\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/Cg-3_6_at_13.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/Cg-3_6_at_13.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/Cg-3_6_at_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>阿德勒。我听到他们给你起了个不错的外号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>嗯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>“哑谜”。不得不承认你的同事们颇具幽默感。我欣赏他们的品味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员放下一摞文件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>虽然你仍然在协助一些密码破译工作，偶尔也请我帮你捎带新的消息和论文。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>但这间屋子不是你的实验室，也不是你的宿舍——更不是你的避难所。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>回到普通的生活里不会有什么坏处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我在听。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>你没听。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员叹了一口气，放下手里的壁球。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>好吧，我知道你希望我说什么。那么——外面的情况如何了，格蕾塔？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我猜大伙儿一定很忙吧，他们已经放弃了往我门口放智能机器人，也懒得再来邀请我加入各种研究小组。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>是“暴雨”研究有了新突破？所有人都打起精神忙着提出好点子？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员沉默了片刻。她轻轻摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>又一场雨突然降临了。我听说有些研究员本来正在外面采集数据……他们来不及赶回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>基金会的情况也不太好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他本想让拳头重重地落向桌面。最后他只是疲倦地将满桌的稿纸推向一边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜 ：</div><div>这样吗。我知道了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_11\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-3_6_at_11.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-3_6_at_11.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-3_6_at_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_14\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-3_6_at_14.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-3_6_at_14.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-3_6_at_14.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一定有某个理由。它驱使着你在此时此地，依然坚持站在这扇门前。<br />要求从未有过的回应。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:166%\">自我的期望。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_06\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-3_6_bg_06.png/600px-Cg-3_6_bg_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-3_6_bg_06.png/900px-Cg-3_6_bg_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-3_6_bg_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_bg_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-648701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-648701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-648701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>我听过科算中心的讲座。那些研究员都坚信自己能发现真理。这简直太自负了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-648701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-648701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-648701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>——但就应该如此。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:166%\">他人的期望。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我会去接受那个职务！我会去做你希望我做的事！我会去和那些我厌烦的委员们打交道——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>但不是为了楼宇顶层的那些俯瞰我们的大人物们——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——而是为了那些在外面仰慕这座大厦的人！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:166%\">改变一切的期望。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_19_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_19_zone\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_19_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a1/Cg-3_6_bg_19_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"1409\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"172\" data-file-height=\"404\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>因为我希望拉普拉斯仍是一个能有你们这些家伙的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>总要有人去做些什么。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_14\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-3_6_at_14.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-3_6_at_14.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-3_6_at_14.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他从未认真审视过眼前的门。困难与阻碍在研究中十分常见，最终成果总是建立在无数次失败的尝试上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第一次，他往后退了几步，好认清这位长久以来与自己搏斗的亲密敌人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我早该这样……不。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-314311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-314311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-314311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>没必要假设过去的事会如何。现在就是个不错的时机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苦目树提取物的效果在消退。随着剧烈的心跳声，他眼前的事物逐渐回归实在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>“玩具箱”里的一切都会随着观测而变化。忠实地复现我的思维，认知，一切念头……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也许是提取物的副作用，也许是眼前所见太过荒谬，又太过意料之中。<br />他的眼眶传来烧灼的疼痛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>哈，原来门的周围根本没有围墙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>未知的黑暗吞没了他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他轻松地迈出了步子。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_16.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_16\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_16\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/Cg-3_6_bg_16.png/600px-Cg-3_6_bg_16.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/Cg-3_6_bg_16.png/900px-Cg-3_6_bg_16.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/Cg-3_6_bg_16.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_bg_16.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“玩具箱”旅程的起点。如今也是终点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>每一次箱中探索都由这片草地出发。他认得出靴底踩在草坪上的感觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>有始有终的循环？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-314311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-314311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-314311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>倒也不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拨开草叶，向着这片绿色的中心而去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那枚核心正躺在草坪中间，等待着下一个执着的探求者将它拾起。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_19_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_19_zone\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_19_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a1/Cg-3_6_bg_19_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"1409\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"172\" data-file-height=\"404\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-645501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-645501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-645501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>这枚核心能读到你的思想。它会让箱子生成你最期望的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-645501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-645501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-645501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>我想创造一门不受任何限制的语言，一门所有人都能理解与使用的语言。于是它为我重建了一座巴别塔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-645501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-645501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-645501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>它太过万能，我不希望你拿到它，沉浸于这个思维游戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-645501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-645501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-645501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>——但你显然已经做了决定。我没能阻拦你，那就只有祝你一切顺利，信念坚定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"645501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-645501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-645501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"645501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-645501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-645501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-645501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-645501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>要是时间足够，还真想见识它会为你创造出什么。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_16.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_16\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_16\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/Cg-3_6_bg_16.png/600px-Cg-3_6_bg_16.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/Cg-3_6_bg_16.png/900px-Cg-3_6_bg_16.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/Cg-3_6_bg_16.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_bg_16.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>世界上有无数这样一望无际的绿色。这也许是他曾经登上的山顶。也许是他难以踏足的墓地。也许是拉普拉斯大楼前的空地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他只想回到最初的草坪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>行了。探险时光结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员弯腰捡起眼前的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>很好。它确实在我的观测下生成了独一份的新密码。我熟悉的，基础的密码……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>以及一张……提示。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>“人类的时代已经结束了。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他轻声念出了纸条上的句子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是尽可能真实的模拟，模拟原型的外貌、语言、思想。这些数据当然会尽职尽责地给出最合理的结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在真实世界，他的抽屉里也有一张这样的纸条。来自一位先行者的日记。<br />她找到了答案，即使在模拟中也同样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>推演证明，她无论多少次都会走上这条路。数据写出了一串既定的命运预言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-314311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-314311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-314311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>哈……神秘学。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LAFP-12"}}